    "description": "FeatureTelemetry.LogUptake accepts Discovered, Set up, Used, and Undiscovered, but the platform records the forward transition only as Discovered to Set up to Used. If the first call for a feature is Set up or Used, no uptake telemetry is emitted. Undiscovered is the explicit reset from any state.",
